=2 Walkthrough
* Go to {z:Ro'Maeve}. You will need {s:Sneak} and {s:Invisible} through this area, but everything in-zone detects magic, so use {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oils|Silent Oil|4165} and {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powders|Prism Powder|4164} or cast {s:Sneak} and {s:Invisible} at the zone.
** You can now also use a mount in this zone.
* If you have it, Survival Guide to {z:Ro'Maeve} is the fastest way, it puts you right at the zone to {z:Hall of the Gods}.
** Unity Warp (125) will put you at the entrance of {z:Ro'Maeve}.
* Head for (H-5) and zone in to {z:Hall of the Gods}.
* Run through the hallway and check the __Cermet Grate__ two times. You will now be on the next mission.

